{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06521","headline":"游茅山五首 一 · 储光羲","name":"游茅山五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年别乡县，西去入皇州。\n此意在观国，不言空远游。\n九衢平若水，利往无轻舟。\n北洛反初路，东江还故丘。\n春山多秀木，碧涧尽清流。\n不见子桑扈，当从方外求。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06521.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06521","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}